---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Human Origin & Unvarnished Reality | About Dual Shield" activePage="about">

	<!-- SECTION 1: HUMAN MOTIVATION & ORIGIN HERO -->
	<section class="pt-16 pb-20 bg-canvas border-b border-stone-200/80 relative z-10">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
			<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
				<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-accent/10 text-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
					HUMAN ORIGIN & PURPOSE
				</span>
				<span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-500">PHAROS UNIVERSITY GRADUATION PROJECT</span>
			</div>
			
			<h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-dark font-bold max-w-4xl tracking-tight mb-6">
				Born From Direct <span class="italic font-normal text-accent">Field Surveys</span> in Egyptian Clinical Units.
			</h1>

			<p class="text-stone-600 text-lg md:text-xl font-sans max-w-3xl leading-relaxed font-light mb-8">
				We are a graduation project team driven by a singular observation: nurses in Egyptian public hospital units spend hours filling paper flowsheets by hand while vital signs slip past unmonitored.
			</p>

			<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-stone-600">
				<div class="bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-stone-300">
					Advisor: <strong>Dr. Mohamed Abdou</strong> (Office of the Dean)
				</div>
				<div class="bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-stone-300">
					Institution: <strong>Pharos University in Alexandria</strong>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- SECTION 2: UNVARNISHED REALITY MATRIX (Parallax Scrollytelling Split) -->
	<section class="py-24 bg-canvas-muted/50 relative z-10 border-b border-stone-200">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
			
			<div class="mb-16">
				<span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-teal font-bold">TRANSPARENT STATUS</span>
				<h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-dark mt-2 font-bold">
					Unvarnished Reality Matrix: <span class="italic font-normal text-stone-600">Current Phase vs. Roadmap</span>
				</h2>
			</div>

			<!-- Split Scrollytelling Matrix -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
				
				<!-- Left Card: Current Reality (Phase 0) -->
				<div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
							<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 font-mono text-xs font-bold">CURRENT REALITY</span>
							<span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-400">PHASE 0</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">Architecture & Field Survey Complete</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 text-base leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
							We do not pretend to be a venture-backed enterprise. We are an engineering blueprint born from direct clinical audits, fully specified and seeking our first hospital unit deployment partner.
						</p>
						<ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600"></i>
								<span>Hospital field survey & paper log audit complete</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600"></i>
								<span>Hardware schematics & load-cell alert circuits engineered</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-600"></i>
								<span>HL7 FHIR v4 database schemas & SQLite edge sync finalized</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-amber-600"></i>
								<span>Seeking 1st clinical unit deployment partner in Alexandria</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Right Card: Future Roadmap (Phase 1 & Beyond) -->
				<div class="bg-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
							<span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-50 text-accent font-mono text-xs font-bold">FUTURE ROADMAP</span>
							<span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-400">PHASE 1–3</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">Clinical Deployment & AI Fine-Tuning</h3>
						<p class="text-stone-600 text-base leading-relaxed font-light mb-6">
							Upon securing our first hospital partner, physical load-cell sensors and counter terminals will be installed for 6-month prospective validation.
						</p>
						<ul class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200">
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half text-sky-600"></i>
								<span>Bedside hardware unit installation on 12 trial beds</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half text-sky-600"></i>
								<span>Dual-database local-to-cloud asynchronous sync testing</span>
							</li>
							<li class="flex items-center gap-2">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-hourglass-half text-sky-600"></i>
								<span>MedGemma & RNN IDH model fine-tuning on local patient data</span>
							</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- SECTION 3: TEAM & ADVISORY GRID -->
	<section class="py-24 bg-canvas relative z-10">
		<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
			
			<div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
				<span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-accent font-bold">THE PEOPLE BEHIND DUAL SHIELD</span>
				<h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-dark mt-2 font-bold">
					Student Team & Academic Supervision
				</h2>
				<p class="text-stone-600 font-sans mt-3 font-light text-base">
					Faculty of Computer Science & Artificial Intelligence — Pharos University in Alexandria (AY 2026/2027)
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Academic Advisor Highlight Card -->
			<div class="bg-dark text-canvas p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-stone-800 shadow-xl mb-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-6">
				<div>
					<span class="font-mono text-xs text-sky-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">PROJECT ADVISOR & DEAN OFFICE</span>
					<h3 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Dr. Mohamed Abdou</h3>
					<p class="text-stone-300 text-sm font-sans mt-2 font-light max-w-xl">
						Supervising clinical software architecture, FHIR data standards compliance, and hospital partner outreach across Alexandria units.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-400 bg-stone-900 px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-800">
					<div>FACULTY OF COMPUTER SCIENCE & AI</div>
					<div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mt-1">ACADEMIC SUPERVISION</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- 6 Student Team Cards Grid -->
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
				
				<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
					<div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-dark">Aya Anwer</div>
					<div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold mt-1">CGPA 3.78</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans mt-2 font-light">Lead AI Engineer • RNN IDH Prediction & MedGemma Dosage Model</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
					<div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-dark">Ahmed Nassar</div>
					<div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold mt-1">CGPA 3.72</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans mt-2 font-light">System Architect • FHIR Database & Offline Edge Synchronization</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
					<div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-dark">Amr Khaled</div>
					<div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold mt-1">CGPA 3.47</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans mt-2 font-light">Hardware Engineer • Load-Cell IV Sensors & Microcontroller Bridge</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
					<div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-dark">Ahmed Gamal</div>
					<div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold mt-1">CGPA 3.45</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans mt-2 font-light">Frontend Developer • Nurse Terminal & Doctor Clinical Console</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
					<div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-dark">Abdelrahman Seif</div>
					<div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold mt-1">CGPA 3.45</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans mt-2 font-light">Biometric Systems • Fingerprint Registration & Shift Queue Rules</p>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm">
					<div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-dark">Shaza Hany</div>
					<div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent font-bold mt-1">CGPA 3.40</div>
					<p class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans mt-2 font-light">Field Researcher • Hospital Survey Audits & Paperwork Mapping</p>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
